          "comment": "# Comfy Video Upscale- Real-ESRGAN\n\nUpload a video to upscale it using a fast GAN model. The output resolution is determined by your chosen model (e.g., 2x or 4x). For best results, upscale first, then resize to your target resolution. Runs on Comfy Cloud and needs a COMFY_API_KEY.\n\n**How it works:** The Comfy nodes form the complete template graph. Run submits the graph to Comfy Cloud and saves its outputs.\n\n**Try this:** Change the prompt or the Load node inputs and run again to compare results.\n\nSource: https://github.com/Comfy-Org/workflow_templates/blob/1ae390968e323dba24a6991d1860ded051f5a79b/templates/utility-gan_upscaler.json (MIT). Model licenses apply separately."
